(7694028, 1261358, 43565, '<td valign="top">The highlights on the flower are blown out. The stem on the right does not add anything to the photo. Overall it seems too bright for a still life.</td>', 'The highlights on the flower are blown out. The stem on the right does not add anything to the photo. Overall it seems too bright for a still life.', '2021-05-11 12:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694038, 1261289, 4008, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and light and I like how you have included the "making of" in the image itself. If that would have been left out you would still have a very attractive image where both light sources make a positive contribution.</td>', 'Lovely colours and light and I like how you have included the "making of" in the image itself. If that would have been left out you would still have a very attractive image where both light sources make a positive contribution.', '2021-05-11 15:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694039, 1261310, 4008, '<td valign="top">I really like the simple composition and the colours, plus the vignette. Lovely warm tones. I don''t like the multitude of reflections in the glass and bottle.</td>', 'I really like the simple composition and the colours, plus the vignette. Lovely warm tones. I don''t like the multitude of reflections in the glass and bottle.', '2021-05-11 15:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694040, 1261340, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice simple still life with balanced composition. I don''t like the structure effect across the total image, much too strong in my view, especially on the apple. The main light source from the top makes the eggs look very flat and the second light source seems to have a different colour temperature from the main one above, it adds a blue tint.</td>', 'Nice simple still life with balanced composition. I don''t like the structure effect across the total image, much too strong in my view, especially on the apple. The main light source from the top makes the eggs look very flat and the second light source seems to have a different colour temperature from the main one above, it adds a blue tint.', '2021-05-11 15:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694041, 1261189, 4008, '<td valign="top">Yes, two or even three light sources. But is it is key and fill light? (I won''t subtract points for that) A nice twist to the challenge but overall the image does not do much for me.</td>', 'Yes, two or even three light sources. But is it is key and fill light? (I won''t subtract points for that) A nice twist to the challenge but overall the image does not do much for me.', '2021-05-11 15:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
